 0 85.5 0 112v352c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h352c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48V306.2c0-10.7-12.9-16-20.5-8.5l-40 40c-2.2 2.3-3.5 5.3-3.5 8.5z\"></path></svg><!-- <i class=\"fas fa-edit icons\"></i> --> Edit Insert</a> <a class=\"btn btn-lg addbut\" href=\"workflow/114820\"><svg class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-list-alt fa-w-16 icons\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-fa-processed=\"\" data-prefix=\"fas\" data-icon=\"list-alt\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M464 480H48c-26.51 0-48-21.49-48-48V80c0-26.51 21.49-48 48-48h416c26.51 0 48 21.49 48 48v352c0 26.51-21.49 48-48 48zM128 120c-22.091 0-40 17.909-40 40s17.909 40 40 40 40-17.909 40-40-17.909-40-40-40zm0 96c-22.091 0-40 17.909-40 40s17.909 40 40 40 40-17.909 40-40-17.909-40-40-40zm0 96c-22.091 0-40 17.909-40 40s17.909 40 40 40 40-17.909 40-40-17.909-40-40-40zm288-136v-32c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12H204c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v32c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h200c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12zm0 96v-32c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12H204c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v32c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h200c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12zm0 96v-32c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12H204c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v32c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h200c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12z\"></path></svg><!-- <i class=\"fas fa-list-alt icons\"></i> --> Insert Workflow</a><br><br><div class=\"whitebar\"><div class=\"col-sm-12\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><h2> Anti microbial resistance: Threat to humanity.</h2></div><div class=\"col-sm-6 text-right\"><strong>By: <a href=\"user-view/127\">Mart-Marie Faure</a> | Commission</strong></div></div><div class=\"col-sm-12\"><br><div class=\"col-sm-9 inspadd\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Proposal</h3><br><span class=\"headin\">Show:</span> Carte Blanche<br><br><span class=\"headin\">One Liner (Tonight on Carte Blanche...):</span><br>Will so called super bugs become the biggest threat to humanity in the twenty first century?<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Unique Selling Point:</span><br>The threat of so-called super bugs is a major challenge facing humanity in the twenty-first century. <br>\nThat is according to the World Health Organisation. The misuse and overuse of antibiotics in medicine and food production has  created antimicrobial resistance making some diseases almost untreatable leading to millions of deaths in the future. <br><br><span class=\"headin\">Summary: </span><br>Superbugs are strains of bacteria, viruses, parasites and fungi that are resistant to most of the antibiotics and other medications commonly used to treat the infections they cause. A few examples of superbugs include resistant bacteria that can cause pneumonia, urinary tract infections and skin infections.<br>\nResearch has show that to date, the environment has been the neglected component in the one-health triad, One health triad being human, animal and environment. <br>\n<br>\nThe transmission of AMR is probably multi-directional, <br>\nResearch is  currently being done  on wastewater as well as soil that’s been fertilised with the manure from pigs and poultry fed with antimicrobials as well as  environmental surveillance within wastewater close to informal settlements and hospital effluent and wastewater treatment plants, focusing on the environmental dimensions.<br>\n<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Extra Budget Items: </span><br>Flights to Durban<br>\n1 Nights accommodation in Durban<br>\nCar Hire<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Case Study:</span><br><a href=\"case-study/114855\">Ingrid  Schoeman</a><br><a href=\"case-study/114856\">Vanessa Carter</a><br><br><span class=\"headin\">Expert:</span><br><a href=\"expert/114847\">Sahiba  Essack</a><br><br><span class=\"headin\">Other Footage Sources:</span><br>Story Blocks Motion Array<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Hidden Camera:</span> No<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Legal:</span> No<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Graphics:</span> No<br></div><div class=\"col-sm-3\"><div class=\"panel panel-default\" style=\"margin:0px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-h